{
  "bodyHash": "oe05yGlsue0=",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态之树</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克</a></span></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/910/506/quark.png\" alt=\"标题图\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\">本模组使青蛙模组（Quark）与动态之树（Dynamic Trees）兼容，为前述模组添加的树木增加了动态生长的版本，并在世界生成时完全替换它们。<br>树木、其行为及生成可通过使用树木包进行自定义和调整。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>特性</strong></strong></h2><h4><strong>包含的树木</strong></h4><h5>（1.20.1版）</h5><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">火焰号角</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">霜冻号角</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">宁静号角</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">阳光号角</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">温暖号角</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">灰烬树</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">辉光蘑菇（当安装了动态之树+时）&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul><h5>（1.16.5 / 1.18.2版）</h5><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">火焰之花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">霜冻之花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">宁静之花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">阳光之花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">甜蜜之花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">温暖之花</span></li>\n</ul><h5>（1.12.2版）</h5><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">花树</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">沼泽橡树</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></span></li>\n</ul><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>夸克的杜鹃木</strong></h4><h5>（1.18.2版）</h5><p>安装此附加组件后，杜鹃花树将使用夸克的杜鹃木原木，并且会掉落更多原木以使其更加实用。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/910/501/image.png\" alt=\"杜鹃花树\" width=\"1206\" height=\"942\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>世界生成</strong></h4><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">动态夸克树会自然生成在世界中。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">生成的杜鹃花树也将带有夸克的杜鹃花木材。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">在1.12.2版本中，由于夸克的配置设置，该附加组件无法自行禁用非动态树木的生成。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">这可以通过在夸克设置中禁用花树和沼泽树轻松解决。&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他附加组件</strong></strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">动态之树针对其他模组的附加组件可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态之树的CurseForge页面</a>找到。<br></span></p><h4><strong>建议与请求</strong></h4><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">要请求添加新的模组兼容性，请在这里提出！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>前置要求</strong></strong></h2><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态之树<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>许可与整合包</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以在任何你喜欢的整合包中使用本模组！无需询问。<br>本模组使用<strong>MIT</strong>许可证，其源代码已在GitHub上公开。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
